    "result_text": "The suite is green. Done.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec requires each owner response to include `selfLink` = `/api/owners/<id>`. The test reads it back via `GET /api/owners/{id}` and asserts `$.selfLink` equals `/api/owners/` + the new owner's id.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema (which generates `OwnerDto`).\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that derives `selfLink` as `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-safe when the owner has no id). Placing it in the mapper means every owner response \u2014 GET, POST, and list \u2014 carries a consistent `selfLink`.\n\n`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
